'''Corodragon''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.0 Update|Patch 1.0.0]] of [[The Battle Cats Unite!]] It was distributed during the「次世代ワールドホビーフェア'19 Winter」(''Next Generation World Fair Winter 2019'') event in which the attendee would redeem the [[Serial Codes|Serial Code]] to obtain said unit. More opportunities were provided later on with the May 2019 and October 2023 CoroCoro Comic Issues to unlock Corodragon or if they already redeemed him before, gain a "+" level. As of now, Corodragon is exclusive to the '''Japanese''' ('''JP''') version.

